Integração do driver na árvore da libfprint (master 1.94.100):

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ drivers_info = {
     'nb1010': {},
+    'ft9201': {},

--- a/libfprint/meson.build
+++ b/libfprint/meson.build
@@ driver_sources = {
     'nb1010' : files('drivers/nb1010.c'),
+    'ft9201' : files('drivers/ft9201.c'),

Compilar:
  meson setup build --prefix=/usr -Ddrivers=all -Ddoc=false \
        -Dgtk-examples=false -Dintrospection=false -Dinstalled-tests=false
  meson compile -C build

Testar sem substituir a libfprint do sistema:
  sudo systemctl stop fprintd
  sudo LD_LIBRARY_PATH=<build>/libfprint G_MESSAGES_DEBUG=all /usr/libexec/fprintd
